# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Local env config. Vite loads .env, .env.[mode] and their .local variants;
# `*.local` above only covers the last of those. Templates stay committed.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.template

# TypeScript incremental build cache. tsconfig currently points this at
# node_modules/.tmp, but catch it here too if that config ever changes.
*.tsbuildinfo

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
